  "_note_banned_words": "banned_words: words/phrases that must NEVER appear in any video script or student-facing text for this chapter - trivia, analogies or framing the book itself does not use. Distinct from core/video_script/contract.py's own BANNED_WORDS/BANNED_PHRASES (filler words banned chapter-wide, e.g. 'just', 'simply') - this list is PER CHAPTER and should hold only this book's specific out-of-scope words (e.g. a named historical anecdote the book does not tell, a unit the book does not use).",
